  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Toss the pul biber with a tablespoon of olive oil and roast in the oven for 10 minutes.",
    "Cook the pasta according to package instructions until al dente.",
    "In a food processor, combine the roasted pul biber, basil, garlic, pine nuts, and a pinch of salt and pepper.",
    "Process the mixture until it forms a smooth pesto sauce.",
    "In a large skillet, combine the cooked pasta, pesto sauce, and grated parmesan cheese.",
    "Toss the pasta in the skillet over low heat until the cheese is melted and the sauce is well combined.",
    "Season the pasta with salt, pepper, and a squeeze of lemon juice to taste.",
    "Serve the pasta hot in a tajine clay vessel."
